OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carers praise Dolly
OL,4,AParton's book scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoster carers have shared how Dolly
OL,7,FParton's free book scheme has helped
OL,8,Fchildren.
OL,10,FThe country singer, who died on
OL,11,FTuesday, established her Imagination
OL,12,FLibrary in 1995 in Tennessee to provide
OL,13,Fbooks from birth to age five, and it
OL,14,Fwas then launched in the UK in 2007.
OL,16,FBarbara Hubbard, from Berwick,
OL,17,FNorthumberland, has been a carer for
OL,18,Fmore than 10 years and said the scheme
OL,19,Fwas "just amazing".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
