OL,3,GNEWSAFoster carers praise Dolly
OL,4,AParton's book scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whenever I've had under-fives, I've
OL,7,Fhad one of the Dolly Parton books
OL,8,Farrive through my letterbox each month
OL,9,Ffor that child," the 62-year-old told
OL,10,FBBC Radio Newcastle.
